<title>HONG KONG: HK's Citybus shares debuts at HK$1.43.</title>
<headline>HK's Citybus shares debuts at HK$1.43.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Citybus Group Ltd, the bus operations unit of CNT Group Ltd, made their trading debut at HK$1.43 per share in Hong Kong, comapred with their issue price of HK$1.42 each.</p>
</text>
